      "message": "The mismatch is intended, although there\u0027s no strong reason. Do you have a specific concern here?\n\nIf you want to match hierachy between host and overlayable nodes, then we can do as following:\n\n```\n    fragment@backlight {\n        target-path \u003d \"/\";\n        __overlay__ {\n            bus0 {\n                backlight {\n                    compatible \u003d \"android,backlight\";\n                    android,backlight,ignore-gctrl-reset;\n                    phandle \u003d \u003c0x7\u003e;\n                };\n            };\n        };\n    };\n```",
